#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_3F_1R/scripts.inc:14
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_3F_1R_Text_Grunt9Intro"
msgid ""
"What did I do to deserve this guard\n"
"posting?\p"
"My left ear is burning up!$"
msgstr ""
"我做了什么，要被派到这里看守啊？\p"
"我的左耳朵都快烧起来了！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_3F_1R/scripts.inc:19
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_3F_1R_Text_Grunt9Defeat"
msgid "I'm getting heat exhaustion…$"
msgstr "我快中暑了……$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_3F_1R/scripts.inc:22
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_3F_1R_Text_Grunt9PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Do you think it's odd that we're wearing\n"
"hoods in this magma-filled volcano?$"
msgstr ""
"在这座充满岩浆的火山里还戴着兜帽，\n"
"你觉得奇怪吗？$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_3F_1R/scripts.inc:26
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_3F_1R_Text_Grunt16Intro"
msgid ""
"We joined so we can help our leader\n"
"achieve his fantastic vision.\p"
"I don't care if you're with TEAM AQUA\n"
"or if you're just some kid passing by.\p"
"No one interferes with us and gets\n"
"away with it!$"
msgstr ""
"我们加入熔岩队，\n"
"是为了帮助首领实现他伟大的理想。\p"
"不管你是海洋队的人，\n"
"还是路过的小孩，我都不在乎。\p"
"谁敢妨碍我们，都别想全身而退！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_3F_1R/scripts.inc:34
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_3F_1R_Text_Grunt16Defeat"
msgid ""
"Oh, no!\n"
"You're not to be trusted at all!$"
msgstr "糟糕！你根本就不能信任！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_3F_1R/scripts.inc:38
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_3F_1R_Text_Grunt16PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Listen to me.\n"
"TEAM MAGMA is right!\p"
"Don't listen to TEAM AQUA.\n"
"Don't believe their lies!$"
msgstr ""
"听我说。熔岩队才是对的！\p"
"别听海洋队的话。别相信他们的谎言！$"
